By the way, I’m not against asking AI for opinions on my current research; sometimes it can be quite insightful. AI can, and sometimes does, suggest things I hadn’t thought of. But there is a big difference between using AI to refine your own project and asking it to invent one for which you don’t even have the background to understand that it is nonsense.
